    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swipe the number tiles and create 2048 in this super fun puzzle game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 2048 Puzzle Game \u2013 Simple yet addictive number puzzle!\u00a0Merge tiles with the same number to create the 2048 tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 Tiles appear as powers of 2: 2, 4, 8... and grow bigger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Think strategically with every move! Merge same-number tiles by sliding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Move the board in four directions (\u2190 \u2191 \u2192 \u2193) to combine tiles and generate new ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A 2 or 4 tile is randomly generated each turn. Reach 2048 before the board fills up!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swipe the number tiles and create 2048 in this super fun puzzle game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 2048 Puzzle Game \u2013 Simple yet addictive number puzzle!\u00a0Merge tiles with the same number to create the 2048 tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 Tiles appear as powers of 2: 2, 4, 8... and grow bigger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Think strategically with every move! Merge same-number tiles by sliding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Move the board in four directions (\u2190 \u2191 \u2192 \u2193) to combine tiles and generate new ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A 2 or 4 tile is randomly generated each turn. Reach 2048 before the board fills up!</p></li></ul>",
